      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِرِّيجٌ</span></b> , like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِكِّينٌ</span>, (K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُرَّيْجٌ</span>, (so in the L,)
